$ factory work move -h
exit 0
--- stdout
usage: factory work move [flags] <id> <state>

Ask the server to move a work item to another state. The state machine
decides; when it refuses, the states the item may move to are printed.

Flags:
  --output FORMAT
      output format: table or json (default table)
  --reason STRING
      why, recorded on the item's timeline
  --server URL
      the factory server's URL, such as http://127.0.0.1:8080 (default
      $FACTORY_SERVER)

Environment:
  FACTORY_SERVER       the server's URL when --server is not given
  FACTORY_API_TOKEN    the API token the server was started with
--- stderr
